isDeleted": false, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "roughness": 0, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 680913935, "strokeColor": "#ced4da", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "updated": 1793904880856, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 398117299}, {"id": "tc-1a-tab-t", "type": "text", "x": 85504, "y": 230, "width": 165, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 22, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c1Or", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "Mesures desktop", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 1726091024, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "Mesures desktop", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793904880856, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 674924792, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "tc-1a-tab-b", "type": "text", "x": 85504, "y": 274, "width": 952, "height": 361.25, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 17, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c1Os", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "Fond Gray 100.\n1\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Trois cartes accol\u00e9es 920 \u00d7 500 (x 260, y 170) : 307, 306 et 307 de\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0large ; rayon 8 aux coins ext\u00e9rieurs seulement ; Gold 500,\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Cyan 800, Green 950.\n2\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Marge interne 48 ; ic\u00f4ne 64 \u00d7 40 (SVG du starter) \u00e0 52 du haut.\n3\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Titre Big Shoulders Display 40 px 700 Gray 100, majuscules\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0(\u00ab SEDANS \u00bb), encre \u00e0 130 du haut.\n4\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Paragraphe Lexend Deca 15 px 400, blanc \u00e0 75 %, 5 lignes de 25 px,\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u2248 210 px de large, 40 sous le titre.\n5\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00ab Learn More \u00bb : pilule 148 \u00d7 50 (contour 2 px), fond Gray 100,\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0texte 15 px de la couleur de la carte ; en bas de la carte (y 574),\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0align\u00e9s sur les trois cartes.\n\nSurvol (etats.jpg) : fond transparent, contour 2 px et texte Gray 100.\nTailles cal\u00e9es : titres 40 (\u2264 2 %, Big Shoulders Display ; la famille\n\u00ab Big Shoulders \u00bb actuelle de Google donne 35 px : \u00e0 v\u00e9rifier en\nPhase 3) \u00b7 texte 15 (\u2264 2 %) \u00b7 bouton 15.", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 815965624, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "Fond Gray 100.\n1\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Trois cartes accol\u00e9es 920 \u00d7 500 (x 260, y 170) : 307, 306 et 307 de\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0large ; rayon 8 aux coins ext\u00e9rieurs seulement ; Gold 500,\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Cyan 800, Green 950.\n2\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Marge interne 48 ; ic\u00f4ne 64 \u00d7 40 (SVG du starter) \u00e0 52 du haut.\n3\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Titre Big Shoulders Display 40 px 700 Gray 100, majuscules\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0(\u00ab SEDANS \u00bb), encre \u00e0 130 du haut.\n4\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Paragraphe Lexend Deca 15 px 400, blanc \u00e0 75 %, 5 lignes de 25 px,\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u2248 210 px de large, 40 sous le titre.\n5\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00ab Learn More \u00bb : pilule 148 \u00d7 50 (contour 2 px), fond Gray 100,\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0texte 15 px de la couleur de la carte ; en bas de la carte (y 574),\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0align\u00e9s sur les trois cartes.\n\nSurvol (etats.jpg) : fond transparent, contour 2 px et texte Gray 100.\nTailles cal\u00e9es : titres 40 (\u2264 2 %, Big Shoulders Display ; la famille\n\u00ab Big Shoulders \u00bb actuelle de Google donne 35 px : \u00e0 v\u00e9rifier en\nPhase 3) \u00b7 texte 15 (\u2264 2 %) \u00b7 bouton 15.", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793904880856, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1944411668, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "tc-1b-t", "type": "text", "x": 84000, "y": 1210, "width": 473, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 22, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c1Ot", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "1B \u00b7 Mobile 375 \u00d7 1502 (mobile.jpg, \u00e0 50 %)", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 1517066123, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "1B \u00b7 Mobile 375 \u00d7 1502 (mobile.jpg, \u00e0 50 %)", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793904880856, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 391910885, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "tc-img-m-cadre", "type": "rectangle", "x": 84000, "y": 1250, "width": 188, "height": 751, "angle": 0, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c1Ou", "isDeleted": false, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "roughness": 0, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1634932002, "strokeColor": "#ced4da", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "updated": 1793904880856, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 309385658}, {"id": "tc-1b-tab", "type": "rectangle", "x": 84240, "y": 1250, "width": 1180, "height": 330, "angle": 0, "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa", "boundElements": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c1Ov", "isDeleted": false, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "roughness": 0, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1322498156, "strokeColor": "#ced4da", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "updated": 1793904880856, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 43279222}, {"id": "tc-1b-tab-t", "type": "text", "x": 84264, "y": 1270, "width": 220, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, 