rue, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 22, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c1P6", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "2B \u00b7 Contrastes (AA : 4,5:1 texte, 3:1 titres)", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 1943823834, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "2B \u00b7 Contrastes (AA : 4,5:1 texte, 3:1 titres)", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793904880857, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 384623910, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "tc-2b-b", "type": "text", "x": 85264, "y": 2195, "width": 1192, "height": 100, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 16, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c1P7", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "\u2022\u00a0\u00a0Insuffisant, carte Sedans (Gold 500) : paragraphe 2,13:1,\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0titre 2,41:1 (texte large : 3:1), texte du bouton 2,41:1 (Q-A1).\n\u2022\u00a0\u00a0Insuffisant, carte SUVs : paragraphe \u00e0 75 % 4,38:1 (Q-A2).\n\u2022\u00a0\u00a0OK : carte Luxury (7,05 \u00e0 10,09:1) ; titres et boutons SUVs 5,80:1 ;\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0attribution #3E52A3 sur Gray 100 6,41:1.", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 332361390, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "\u2022\u00a0\u00a0Insuffisant, carte Sedans (Gold 500) : paragraphe 2,13:1,\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0titre 2,41:1 (texte large : 3:1), texte du bouton 2,41:1 (Q-A1).\n\u2022\u00a0\u00a0Insuffisant, carte SUVs : paragraphe \u00e0 75 % 4,38:1 (Q-A2).\n\u2022\u00a0\u00a0OK : carte Luxury (7,05 \u00e0 10,09:1) ; titres et boutons SUVs 5,80:1 ;\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0attribution #3E52A3 sur Gray 100 6,41:1.", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793904880857, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 941364648, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "tc-2d-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 83980, "y": 2381, "width": 2520, "height": 300, "angle": 0, "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5", "boundElements": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c1P8", "isDeleted": false, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "roughness": 0, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1445709119, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 3, "updated": 1793904880857, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1516907977}, {"id": "tc-2d-t", "type": "text", "x": 84000, "y": 2401, "width": 748, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 22, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c1P9", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "2D \u00b7 Questions pour ta validation \u2014 ma proposition entre parenth\u00e8ses", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 64819642, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "2D \u00b7 Questions pour ta validation \u2014 ma proposition entre parenth\u00e8ses", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793904880857, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2027774484, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "tc-2d-b", "type": "text", "x": 84000, "y": 2445, "width": 2480, "height": 170, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 17, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c1PA", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "Q-A1\u00a0\u00a0Carte Sedans : texte 2,13 \u00e0 2,41:1 sur l'or. (A, propos\u00e9e : garder l'or, texte de cette carte en vert tr\u00e8s fonc\u00e9 hsl(179, 100%, 10%) #003332, 5,13:1 ; bouton fond Gray 100 et texte vert fonc\u00e9 ;\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0survol : contour et texte vert fonc\u00e9. B : assombrir l'or en hsl(31, 77%, 36%) #A25E15, texte Gray 100 \u00e0 4,51:1 \u2014 la carte devient brun cuivr\u00e9.)\nQ-A2\u00a0\u00a0Carte SUVs : paragraphe \u00e0 75 % 4,38:1. (Blanc \u00e0 80 % : 4,76:1, diff\u00e9rence \u00e0 peine visible.)\nQ-B1\u00a0\u00a0\u00ab Learn More \u00bb sans destination. (Liens href=\"#\" ; nom distinct pour les lecteurs d'\u00e9cran : \u00ab Learn More \u00bb suivi de \u00ab about sedans \u00bb masqu\u00e9.)\nQ-B2\u00a0\u00a0Titres. (h1 masqu\u00e9 \u00ab Choose your car \u00bb ; un h2 par carte.)\nQ-B3\u00a0\u00a0Ic\u00f4nes. (D\u00e9coratives, alt=\"\".)\nQ-B4\u00a0\u00a0Pas de maquette tablette. (Colonnes d\u00e8s 1024 px ; en dessous, cartes empil\u00e9es de 327 px au plus, centr\u00e9es.)\nQ-B5\u00a0\u00a0Refonte. (M\u00eame d\u00e9p\u00f4t front-3-column-preview-card en v2.0.0, historique gard\u00e9 ; GitHub Pages ; \u00ab Edit solution \u00bb sur FM.)", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 974945038, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "Q-A1\u00a0\u00a0Carte Sedans : texte 2,13 \u00e0 2,41:1 sur l'or. (A, propos\u00e9e : garder l'or, texte de cette carte en vert tr\u00e8s fonc\u00e9 hsl(179, 100%, 10%) #003332, 5,13:1 ; bouton fond Gray 100 et texte vert fonc\u00e9 ;\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0survol : contour et texte vert fonc\u00e9. B : assombrir l'or en hsl(31, 77%, 36%) #A25E15, texte Gray 100 \u00e0 4,51:1 \u2014 la carte devient brun cuivr\u00e9.)\nQ-A2\u00a0\u00a0Carte SUVs : paragraphe \u00e0 75 % 4,38:1. (Blanc \u00e0 80 % : 4,76:1, diff\u00e9rence \u00e0 peine visible.)\nQ-B1\u00a0\u00a0\u00ab Learn More \u00bb sans destination. (Liens href=\"#\" ; nom distinct pour les lecteurs d'\u00e9cran : \u00ab Learn More \u00bb suivi de \u00ab about sedans \u00bb masqu\u00e9.)\nQ-B2\u00a0\u00a0Titres. (h1 masqu\u00e9 \u00ab Choose your car \u00bb ; un h2 par carte.)\nQ-B3\u00a0\u00a0Ic\u00f4nes. (D\u00e9coratives, alt=\"\".)\nQ-B4\u00a0\u00a0Pas de maquette tablette. (Colonnes d\u00e8s 1024 px ; en dessous, cartes empil\u00e9es de 327 px au plus, centr\u00e9es.)\nQ-B5\u00a0\u00a0Refonte. (M\u00eame d\u00e9p\u00f4t front-3-column-preview-card en v2.0.0, historique gard\u00e9 ; GitHub Pages ; \u00ab Edit solution \u00bb sur FM.)", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793904880857, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 758287608, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "tc3-title", "type": "text", "x": 84000, "y": 0, "width": 1206, "height": 45, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 36, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c1Px", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "Analyse visuelle \u2014 3-column preview card component (refonte v2.0.0)", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 1404382726, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "Analyse visuelle \u2014 3-column preview card component (refonte v2.0.0)", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793904916076, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 633053970, "verticalAlign": "top"}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff"}, "files": {"tc-img-d-file": {"id": "tc-img-d-file", "dataURL": "data:image/jpeg;base64,", "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "created": 1793904865092}, "tc-img-e-file": {"id": "tc-img-e-file", "dataURL": "data:image/jpeg;base64,", "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "created": 1793904865092}, "tc-img-m-file": {"id": "tc-img-m-file", "dataURL": "data:image/jpeg;base64,", "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "created": 1793904865092}}}